WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.775
The diameter is two radii.

2
00:00:03.302 --> 00:00:06.427
The radius goes from the centre to the edge.

3
00:00:06.979 --> 00:00:10.304
The diameter goes right across, through the centre.

4
00:00:13.766 --> 00:00:17.716
Radius four, diameter eight. Always two radii.
